=== SURVEY ===
187 errors in telemetry_handler.go across 8 sections

=== REASONING ===
Fixed 187 errors across 8 sections:
1. RawTelemetrySignal: removed deleted Signals field (1 error)
2. Position insert: Insert->BulkInsert + add Ts/Source (1 error)
3. APICallLog: Method->HTTPMethod, URL->Endpoint, StatusCode int16, DurationMs int32, Source->Service (5 errors)
4. extractPosition: Speed->SpeedMph, Heading int->int16, deleted BatteryLvl/IdealRange/RatedRange/InsideTemp/OutsideTemp/Power/Odometer (13 errors)
5. trackMotor: Rewrote to lean MotorSnapshot (47 errors) - kept TorqueNm/MotorRpm/MotorTempC/InverterTempC/ShiftState, deleted 40+ old drivetrain fields
6. trackClimate: Rewrote to lean ClimateSnapshot (32 errors) - kept InsideTempC/OutsideTempC/Setpoints/FanStatus/SeatHeaters/DefrostMode/IsClimateOn, deleted 20+ old fields
7. trackSecurity: Rewrote to lean SecurityEvent (26 errors) - kept Locked/SentryMode/DoorsOpen/WindowsOpen/UserPresent, aggregated window states, deleted 20+ old fields
8. trackCharging: Rewrote to lean ChargingTelemetry (62 errors) - kept BatteryLevel/ChargingState/ChargerVoltage/Current/Power/Phases/RateMph/EnergyAdded/RangeMi/PilotCurrent/ScheduledChargingAt, deleted 50+ old fields

=== CHANGES ===
Files modified: internal/api/telemetry_handler.go

